  "body": "The webIDL for `Window` https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#window includes:\r\n```\r\n  [Unforgeable] readonly attribute WindowProxy top;\r\n  [Replaceable] readonly attribute WindowProxy parent;\r\n```\r\nbut the spec for these attributes says they can return `null`, so they should be optional.",
